  "note": "Mahua Saha (162 cm) keeps the hardware store, location.nabapara.hardware_store, every day of the week, and lives off-lane behind its front threshold (location.nabapara.saha_home, a 1820 cm authored walk from the front-door anchor, 13 minutes). The door's business hours are 09:00-13:00 and 15:00-20:00 (door.nabapara.hardware_store_front); in both windows she is at the shop. Monday to Saturday she sleeps until 06:30, washes, cooks and eats, walks in (24 minutes) and does the opening stock check in the stock room from 08:20, and is at the staff counter by 09:00. Serving at the counter alternates with weighing loose goods at the weigh station and restocking in the stock room. At 13:00 she goes through to the stock room and takes her midday meal there, weighs and packs until 15:00 and is back at the counter at 15:00. After 20:00 she checks the weigh station and walks home (25 minutes), cooks, eats, reads and sleeps from 23:00. On Sunday she rises at 07:30 and walks straight to the counter, takes one restock in each half and a longer midday rest. Built routes are the kit's staff polylines for the 1200 by 700 store: counter to stock room 1135 cm, to weigh station 1197 cm, to the door anchor 2100 cm; and two sub-paths of those same polylines: weigh station to stock room 158 cm, door to stock room 1505 cm. Every travel duration is ceil(sum(lengthCm)/140).",
